00:12:21,010 --> 00:12:25,430
So, you wanted to talk about Soma, right?

1521
00:12:26,680 --> 00:12:27,520
Yeah.

1522
00:12:31,810 --> 00:12:32,940
Hey.

1523
00:12:33,940 --> 00:12:35,320
Which team?

1524
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:36,690
The losing one.

1525
00:12:38,900 --> 00:12:40,280
Hello!

1526
00:12:40,700 --> 00:12:42,570
Oh, you're here, Soma!

1527
00:12:42,570 --> 00:12:45,450
I'm sorry I'm late, Saeki-senpai.

1528
00:12:45,450 --> 00:12:48,410
I asked you to come all the way out here. Don't sweat it.

1529
00:12:48,410 --> 00:12:49,120
Who's that?

1530
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,710
Oh, he's my friend.

1531
00:12:50,710 --> 00:12:53,950
We used to play ball in middle school, 
so I brought him along.

1532
00:12:54,460 --> 00:12:55,630
I'm Izumi.

1533
00:12:55,630 --> 00:12:58,510
So, you two have experience. We're gonna win today.

1534
00:12:59,340 --> 00:13:01,590
Komada-san, this is Soma.

1535
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:05,060
He's my junior from high school. 
He's gonna come work at our factory in the spring.

1536
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:05,850
I see.

1537
00:13:07,140 --> 00:13:08,100
Hm?

1538
00:13:10,140 --> 00:13:12,190
Nice. You're huge.

1539
00:13:21,410 --> 00:13:23,320
Nice batting, Shindo-san!

1540
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:26,490
All right! Keep going, Ishii. The pitcher's strong!

1541
00:13:26,490 --> 00:13:27,830
First, let's get a point!

1542
00:13:28,950 --> 00:13:31,670
You guys are pretty serious about this.

1543
00:13:31,670 --> 00:13:33,630
It wouldn't be fun, if we weren't.

1544
00:13:34,040 --> 00:13:36,000
All right! Go, go!

1545
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:39,470
Yeah, I guess...

1546
00:13:42,430 --> 00:13:43,570
I see.

1547
00:13:44,220 --> 00:13:46,960
So, Soma actually asked you out.

1548
00:13:47,430 --> 00:13:51,520
Everyone knew, huh?
 Yoriko talked about it the other day.

1549
00:13:51,520 --> 00:13:56,930
Sorry. I was the one who suggested 
that we leave you and Soma alone together.

1550
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:58,220
It's okay.

1551
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:05,280
Still, that means... you're fine with rejecting him, right?

1552
00:14:05,950 --> 00:14:07,280
Yeah.

1553
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:14,170
It was a first for me.

1554
00:14:14,170 --> 00:14:18,170
It caught me off guard, so I responded immediately.

1555
00:14:19,060 --> 00:14:25,340
But now, I think I probably should've 
given it some thought before responding.

1556
00:14:27,260 --> 00:14:28,370
Does that mean...

1557
00:14:29,980 --> 00:14:34,570
You might answer differently 
if you were asked right now?

1558
00:14:35,650 --> 00:14:39,750
I think... I'd give him the same answer again.

1559
00:14:41,470 --> 00:14:47,070
Oh, but that doesn't mean I hate 
or dislike him or anything like that.

1560
00:14:47,610 --> 00:14:48,610
Yeah.

1561
00:14:49,250 --> 00:14:54,960
It's just that Soma-kun 
and I hadn't really talked until recently,

1562
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:56,880
and there's so much I don't know about him.

1563
00:14:57,300 --> 00:14:59,800
It's much too soon to go out with him right now.

1564
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:00,670
Yeah.

1565
00:15:00,670 --> 00:15:05,300
Besides, I won't be in town once we graduate.

1566
00:15:07,180 --> 00:15:11,720
I've been thinking about Soma all 
the time, ever since that day.

1567
00:15:14,770 --> 00:15:18,520
It's kind of embarrassing... talking about this stuff.

1568
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:20,570
Why don't you tell him?

1569
00:15:24,030 --> 00:15:26,860
Tell him you want to answer 
his question again but properly.

1570
00:15:27,520 --> 00:15:28,870
Well...

1571
00:15:28,870 --> 00:15:31,620
I think it'd be good news for him.

1572
00:15:35,120 --> 00:15:40,130
But after thinking carefully about it, I'm sure 
it'll probably be tough for him to be rejected again.

1573
00:15:41,010 --> 00:15:44,460
Will Soma-kun hear me out?

1574
00:15:44,460 --> 00:15:47,590
I don't know about that.

1575
00:15:48,890 --> 00:15:50,640
Yeah...

1576
00:15:51,510 --> 00:15:54,810
Thanks, Natsume-san! I'll give it a try.

1577
00:15:56,060 --> 00:15:57,140
See you later.

1578
00:15:57,140 --> 00:15:57,900
Okay.

1579
00:16:01,110 --> 00:16:03,070
You'll give it a try, huh?

1580
00:16:04,070 --> 00:16:06,070
I will, too.

1581
00:16:06,070 --> 00:16:08,910
We're gonna hold them off and turn the game around.

1582
00:16:08,910 --> 00:16:10,410
Yeah!

1583
00:16:11,910 --> 00:16:16,750
Gondo-san! I hurt my foot from that slide earlier.

1584
00:16:16,750 --> 00:16:18,040
Will you be okay?

1585
00:16:18,040 --> 00:16:20,130
Yes, sir! I'll be able to work tomorrow!

1586
00:16:20,130 --> 00:16:22,290
I don't mean tomorrow.

1587
00:16:22,290 --> 00:16:25,510
It'll be okay if you let Soma take the field.

1588
00:16:25,510 --> 00:16:26,510
Huh?

1589
00:16:26,510 --> 00:16:28,930
Take my place, Haruto!

1590
00:16:36,210 --> 00:16:38,770
It doesn't feel right using someone's glove.

1591
00:16:39,690 --> 00:16:42,270
Then, why don't you use this?

1592
00:16:42,270 --> 00:16:43,520
What?

1593
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:47,110
This'll feel right.

1594
00:16:47,950 --> 00:16:50,200
Why do you have this?

1595
00:16:50,950 --> 00:16:52,820
You dropped it, so I picked it up.

