1611
00:17:47,340 --> 00:17:49,380
We were so close today!

1612
00:17:49,380 --> 00:17:50,840
Just one more bat!

1613
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:51,510
Yeah!

1614
00:17:51,510 --> 00:17:52,840
If we had one more bat, weâ

1615
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:55,550
Komada-san <i>is</i> Grand Slam Man, after all.

1616
00:17:55,550 --> 00:17:57,850
Meaning, it was definitely gonna be an easy out.

1617
00:17:57,850 --> 00:17:59,430
You asshole!

1618
00:17:59,100 --> 00:18:01,690
They're kinda different from my mom.

1619
00:18:01,690 --> 00:18:02,640
Hm?

1620
00:18:02,640 --> 00:18:04,600
Because she just works all the time.

1621
00:18:04,600 --> 00:18:06,820
My dad's like that, too.

1622
00:18:06,820 --> 00:18:09,440
Adults play ball and make a fuss about it, too, huh?

1623
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:15,620
What is today's MVP doing in the corner?

1624
00:18:15,620 --> 00:18:20,620
The MVP is the pitcher of the opposing team who got 
you out when you had the bases loaded, Komada-san.

1625
00:18:20,620 --> 00:18:24,790
Don't be ridiculous! Eat some yakisoba!

1626
00:18:24,790 --> 00:18:26,500
I'm already full.

1627
00:18:26,880 --> 00:18:28,840
You're still young! Eat more!

1628
00:18:28,840 --> 00:18:31,840
The game would've been all ours with that diving catch.

1629
00:18:31,840 --> 00:18:34,680
And if Soma-kun got to bat, too.

1630
00:18:42,020 --> 00:18:44,850
Yeah, the yakisoba is really good here.

1631
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:48,110
We've got a game next week, so come if you want.

1632
00:18:48,110 --> 00:18:49,360
See ya!

