hang out like today, once I got a job.

1635
00:18:55,490 --> 00:18:57,870
Good thing you'll have a fun workplace.

1636
00:18:58,410 --> 00:18:59,200
Eita.

1637
00:18:59,200 --> 00:18:59,950
Hm?

