last ball!

1650
00:19:43,870 --> 00:19:44,910
Oh?

1651
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:52,630
You went to play baseball, huh?

1652
00:19:54,170 --> 00:19:57,590
My coworker invited me, so I couldn't turn down the offer.

1653
00:19:58,260 --> 00:19:59,930
How was it?

1654
00:20:01,050 --> 00:20:05,350
I didn't know what to think at first. 
There were just old guys with beer bellies.

1655
00:20:05,350 --> 00:20:08,650
But they seriously tried to win the game.

1656
00:20:09,440 --> 00:20:11,060
I guess it was pretty fun.

1657
00:20:11,730 --> 00:20:13,750
Is that so? I'm glad to hear that.

1658
00:20:13,750 --> 00:20:16,030
Seems like you cheered up a bit.

1659
00:20:16,320 --> 00:20:17,110
Huh?

1660
00:20:17,780 --> 00:20:21,200
You were down in the dumps for about a week.

1661
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:24,290
Not really... It was nothing.

1662
00:20:24,870 --> 00:20:26,580
But what about you?

1663
00:20:26,580 --> 00:20:27,830
What about me?

1664
00:20:29,080 --> 00:20:31,330
You always seem busy with work.

1665
00:20:32,590 --> 00:20:34,590
Are you worried about me?

1666
00:20:36,590 --> 00:20:41,720
I'm fine, though. Well, I suppose it's 
hectic and, sometimes, very annoying.

1667
00:20:43,100 --> 00:20:45,600
But occasionally, there are good things about it.

1668
00:20:46,060 --> 00:20:47,350
Good things?

1669
00:20:48,980 --> 00:20:51,730
Like when my son carries my things for me.

1670
00:20:52,360 --> 00:20:54,860
Huh? What's that supposed to mean?

1671
00:20:55,130 --> 00:20:57,420
You'll understand once you become a parent.

1672
00:21:06,370 --> 00:21:07,870
What did you buy?

1673
00:21:07,870 --> 00:21:09,000
Nothing special.

1674
00:21:10,370 --> 00:21:11,790
What a creep.

1675
00:21:11,790 --> 00:21:14,040
It's just a manga.

1676
00:21:15,080 --> 00:21:16,760
I was just kidding.

1677
00:21:18,160 --> 00:21:20,010
You don't have to take it so personally.

1678
00:21:22,550 --> 00:21:23,510
Sorry.

1679
00:21:23,510 --> 00:21:24,680
It doesn't bother me.

1680
00:21:25,470 --> 00:21:27,100
Sorry about the other day, too.

1681
00:21:28,070 --> 00:21:30,770
I think I went too far when I told you 
that it didn't involve you.

1682
00:21:30,770 --> 00:21:33,560
I was the one who said more than I should've. Sorry.

1683
00:21:34,270 --> 00:21:36,820
You didn't mean anything by it, right?

1684
00:21:36,820 --> 00:21:38,030
I guess.

1685
00:21:39,590 --> 00:21:41,070
So, why did you say that?

1686
